    {
      "zh-CN": "往一个点倒沙会堆成尖堆，坑角还空着，中间已经冒出来了。",
      "en": "Pouring at one point makes a peak: the middle overflows while the corners are still empty."
    },
    {
      "zh-CN": "按坑的宽度横着铺，用量和坑的格数差不多。",
      "en": "Spread the sand across the width of each pit, using about as many grains as the pit holds."
    },
    {
      "zh-CN": "左坑 10×4、右坑 6×5：各画一道和坑一样宽的横线，用量刚好够填满。",
      "en": "The left pit is 10×4 and the right one 6×5: draw one horizontal line as wide as each pit, with just enough sand to fill it."
    }
